{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026WW2a97p9oa1795065111.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>國家主席習近平與夫人彭麗媛，昨晚在深圳為出席亞太經合組織APEC會議的領導人舉行歡迎宴會。中方在迎接各領導人進場時盡顯心思，安排深圳管弦樂團，演奏各地名曲。各位領導人進場時，顯得相當受落。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"20261119 apec.music.02.JPG\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20263tvvBnSRug1795064610.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>其中美國總統特朗普進場時，樂團奏起美國愛國歌曲《美麗的美利堅》。特朗普特地停步欣賞，並向樂團鼓掌致意，還站在樂團前面，讓媒體拍照。樂團在俄羅斯總統普京進場時則奏起《俄羅斯舞曲》。此曲來自俄羅斯作曲家柴可夫斯基創作的經典芭蕾舞劇《胡桃夾子》，普京聽後亦面露微笑。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"20261119 apec.music.TRUMP.JPG\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026pLf1V8VUCG1795064704.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"20261119 apec.music.PUTIN.JPG\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hxj0X8ysnz1795064719.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>至於日本首相高市早苗進場時，樂團奏起1960年代名曲《Sukiyaki》。此曲原名為《上を向いて歩こう》，中文翻譯為《昂首向前走》，由日本已故男歌手坂本九原唱。由於歌曲誕生之時，日本正值爆發反對修訂《日美安全保障條約》。有分析指，雖然曲中並無明顯反戰意味，但中方選擇在高市進場時演奏此曲，可謂別具心思。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"20261119 apec.music.TAKAICHI.JPG\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202668VgYPrFMv1795064758.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>對於香港讀者而言，行政長官李家超進場時，樂團奏起《獅子山下》，相信不少人也有共鳴。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"20261119 apec.music.JOHN LEE.JPG\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026arR1UzjsHg1795064647.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:23:59.679943+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":419,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T05:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T19:37:32.648100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:17:20.462852+00:00","content_hash":"93df35ba7c84e1b73c2b315993f671d3b4f7ab0ee3a294df392cca0aac7965c6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:23:59.679943+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}